(dup 0 lt (drop "neg" no) (dup 0 eq (drop 'zero 'retry tag) (ok) if) if) 'classify let
-5 classify {'ok (drop 1) 'no (drop 2) 'retry (drop 3)} case 2 eq assert
0 classify {'ok (drop 1) 'no (drop 2) 'retry (drop 3)} case 3 eq assert
7 classify {'ok (drop 1) 'no (drop 2) 'retry (drop 3)} case 1 eq assert
